# PWA & Mobile UI Standard

This app is a **fixed mobile-first PWA / game UI**.

Do not introduce **uncontrolled responsive behavior**.

## Before changing mobile UI

* **Respect fixed app shell** — `max-w-[390px]` centered column; do not widen or reflow the shell unless explicitly requested
* **Respect safe-area insets** — `env(safe-area-inset-*)` for notches and home indicators
* **Avoid accidental `vw` / `vh` / `clamp()`** in sensitive UI (especially numeric text — see `.cursor/rules/ui-typography.mdc`)
* **Keep touch targets usable** — adequate hit area and spacing for buttons and controls
* **Keep numeric text stable** — `numeric-text numeric-text--{size}`; fixed px for balances, timers, prices
* **Test installed PWA and mobile browser** — standalone vs in-browser can differ (viewport, safe-area, scroll)

## Do not change unless explicitly requested

* Layout width
* Shell behavior
* Visual proportions
* Image-based menu cards / buttons scaling strategy

## Image vs text

Image assets may scale with container width; **real text and numbers** must follow typography rules — do not conflate layout issues with font scaling.

## Related rules

* `.cursor/rules/ui-typography.mdc` — numeric text and forbidden sizing units
* `.cursor/rules/state-management.mdc` — client state on navigation / hard exit in PWA
